---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title="Packing List · China Trip July 2026">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Packing List · China Trip July 2026</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
    This 22-day trip crosses multiple climate zones: humid urban heat in Beijing and Xi'an (30–38°C), high-altitude lakeside (15°C), Qaidam desert basin (28°C), Gobi desert (42°C), and alpine grassland (10–22°C). Pack for all of them.
  </p>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Clothing</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-2/5">Item</th>
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
        <tr><td class="p-3">Light down jacket or fleece</td><td class="p-3">Qinghai Lake, Chaka, Qilian mornings are cold (8–15°C)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">3–4 lightweight shirts</td><td class="p-3">Quick-dry preferred</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">1 pair long trousers</td><td class="p-3">Sun protection in desert; required in Mogao Caves</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">2 pairs shorts</td><td class="p-3">For hot days</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Warm socks</td><td class="p-3">For Qilian morning horseback ride</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Comfortable walking shoes</td><td class="p-3">For dunes, fort walls, cave paths</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Sandals or flip-flops</td><td class="p-3">Hotel evenings; salt lake wading (Chaka)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Old shoes you don't mind ruining</td><td class="p-3">Salt brine at Chaka and Feicui Hu destroys leather</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Light rain jacket</td><td class="p-3">Beijing July has afternoon thunderstorms</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Sun hat with full brim</td><td class="p-3">Dunhuang sun is severe; Xi'an City Wall has no shade</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Sunglasses</td><td class="p-3">Essential — Chaka salt flat reflection is blinding</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Light scarf or buff</td><td class="p-3">Desert dust, sun protection on neck</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Sun & Health</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-2/5">Item</th>
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
        <tr><td class="p-3">Sunscreen SPF 50+</td><td class="p-3">Reapply every 2hrs in Dunhuang</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Lip balm with SPF</td><td class="p-3">Desert air is extremely dry</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Moisturiser</td><td class="p-3">Qaidam Basin humidity is near zero</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Altitude sickness tablets (高原反应药)</td><td class="p-3">Optional but useful for Day 1–2 at 3,200m</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Paracetamol / ibuprofen</td><td class="p-3">Headaches are common at altitude</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Electrolyte sachets or sports drink tablets</td><td class="p-3">Critical for Dunhuang heat days and Xi'an City Wall cycling</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Insect repellent</td><td class="p-3">Beijing hutongs and evening markets attract mosquitoes in July</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Personal medications</td><td class="p-3">Nearest major hospital is Xining on the northwest loop</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Basic first aid: plasters, antiseptic</td><td class="p-3"></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Documents & Money</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-2/5">Item</th>
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
        <tr><td class="p-3">Passport (originals)</td><td class="p-3">Required for hotel check-in in China — every night</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Passport copies (photo + digital)</td><td class="p-3">Keep a photocopy separate from original; photo on phone as backup</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Printed hotel bookings</td><td class="p-3">Some rural hotels don't accept digital</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Forbidden City booking confirmation</td><td class="p-3">Print or screenshot — timed entry</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Mogao Caves booking confirmation</td><td class="p-3">Print or screenshot — needed at gate</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Terracotta Warriors booking confirmation</td><td class="p-3">Print or screenshot</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Train tickets / 12306 confirmations</td><td class="p-3">T231, 7006, D2685 — screenshot or print</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Cash RMB (¥2,000–3,000 per person)</td><td class="p-3">Rural areas often cash-only</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Bank card (Visa/Mastercard)</td><td class="p-3">Works at ATMs in cities; carry as backup</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 rounded-lg p-4 text-sm mb-6">
    <strong>Italian note:</strong> Chinese ATMs in Beijing, Xi'an, Xining, Dunhuang, and Jiayuguan accept foreign Visa/Mastercard. In Chaka, Dachaidan, and Qilian, ATM availability is limited. Withdraw cash in Xining before the northwest loop.
  </div>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Tech & Navigation</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-2/5">Item</th>
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
        <tr><td class="p-3">Phone charger + power bank</td><td class="p-3">Long driving days with navigation drain battery fast</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Car phone mount</td><td class="p-3">For navigation — essential</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Offline maps downloaded</td><td class="p-3">Amap (高德地图) or Baidu Maps work in China; Google Maps does not</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">VPN installed and tested before entering China</td><td class="p-3">Cannot be downloaded inside China</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Camera / extra memory cards</td><td class="p-3">Chaka and Danxia especially</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Universal power adapter</td><td class="p-3">China uses Type A and Type I — most European plugs need adapter</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Car Kit</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-2/5">Item</th>
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
        <tr><td class="p-3">Reusable water bottles (1.5L+ per person)</td><td class="p-3">Fill up in every town; no water sources in Qaidam Basin</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Snacks for Day 3</td><td class="p-3">500km with no towns — bring lunch and snacks</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Wet wipes and hand sanitiser</td><td class="p-3">Bathrooms are basic at some scenic areas</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Small day bag per person</td><td class="p-3">For leaving main luggage in car during sightseeing</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Plastic bags for rubbish</td><td class="p-3">No bins on desert highways</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Car phone charger cable</td><td class="p-3"></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Night Train Essentials (T231 Beijing → Xi'an)</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
    <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800">
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-2/5">Item</th>
          <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-700">
        <tr><td class="p-3">Earplugs + sleep mask</td><td class="p-3">Train corridors have noise and light all night</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Slippers</td><td class="p-3">For walking to the toilet car — don't go barefoot</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Snacks and water</td><td class="p-3">The dining car closes early; bring enough for the evening</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Small towel</td><td class="p-3">Sleeper compartments have no towels</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Entertainment (phone/book)</td><td class="p-3">No reliable WiFi on the train</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="p-3">Padlock or cable lock</td><td class="p-3">Optional — soft sleeper doors lock, but peace of mind</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-6 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What to Leave Behind</h2>
  <ul class="space-y-2 text-[15px] mb-6 list-disc list-inside">
    <li><strong>Heavy luggage</strong> — you have one 7-seater for 7+ people on the northwest loop, space is genuinely tight</li>
    <li><strong>Valuables beyond what's needed</strong> — Chaka, Qilian, Dachaidan are remote with limited security</li>
    <li><strong>White or pale clothing</strong> — Danxia and desert dust will stain it immediately</li>
    <li><strong>Too many formal clothes</strong> — nowhere on this trip requires anything beyond casual</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-gray-500">
    <a href={`${base}`} class="text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">&larr; Full Trip Overview</a>
  </p>
</Base>
